---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import Portrait from '../components/Portrait.astro';
import MysoftLink from '../components/MysoftLink.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
import { breadcrumbNode } from '../lib/schema';
---
<Base
  title="About this guide"
  description="Who publishes The Sage Buyer's Guide, why it exists, and what you should know: it is run by Jamie Watts and Mysoft, a UK Sage Partner with a commercial interest."
  schema={[breadcrumbNode([{ name: 'About', path: '/about/' }]), { '@type': 'AboutPage', '@id': `${site.url}/about/#page`, about: { '@id': site.personId }, publisher: { '@id': site.orgId } }]}
>
  <div class="container narrow doc">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: 'About' }]} />
    <div class="doc-head mt-20">
      <Portrait />
      <div class="stack-sm">
        <span class="eyebrow">About this guide</span>
        <h1>Who runs this site</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>I'm Jamie Watts, Managing Director of Mysoft, a UK Sage Partner with offices in the UK and US. Mysoft has been a Sage Business Partner for more than 20 years, was the UK's first Sage X3 partner, implements Sage Intacct and Sage X3, and builds its own Sage marketplace product, X3CloudDocs.</p>

      <h2>Why this site exists</h2>
      <p>Choosing a finance or ERP system is a high-stakes decision, and you may be comparing options before you talk to anyone. This site sets out the published facts that matter for that choice, with sources: which Sage product fits which business, where Sage is strong, and where another system may suit you better.</p>

      <h2>What you should know</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We are a Sage Partner, so we have a commercial interest in Sage.</li>
        <li>Most links point to Mysoft. Where we link to other products, it is because we think they are relevant, and we label any commercial relationship.</li>
        <li>We will tell you when Sage is not the right fit. A poor fit costs everyone.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we compare</h2>
      <p>Our comparisons use vendors' published information. Each page lists its sources and last-reviewed date. If you spot something out of date, email <a href={`mailto:${site.correctionsEmail}`}>{site.correctionsEmail}</a> and we will correct it. Read the full <a href="/how-we-compare/">editorial policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>About Mysoft</h2>
      <p>Mysoft implements and supports Sage Intacct and Sage X3 for businesses in the UK and North America, and builds X3CloudDocs, its own automation add-on for Sage X3. You can read more about <MysoftLink to="mysoft-who-we-are" position="about-body">who Mysoft is</MysoftLink>, see <MysoftLink to="mysoft-case-studies" position="about-body">Mysoft's customers</MysoftLink>, or <MysoftLink to="mysoft-team" position="about-body">meet the team</MysoftLink>.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For anything about this guide, email <a href={`mailto:${site.correctionsEmail}`}>{site.correctionsEmail}</a>. To talk about a project, <MysoftLink to="mysoft-contact" position="about-contact">contact Mysoft directly</MysoftLink>.</p>
      <p class="small muted">{site.company.name}. Company number {site.company.number}. {site.company.address}.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
